(R/'README.zh-TW.md').write_text('# Koma Studio 0.6.0-alpha / Atelier\n\n'+intro+'\n\n'+notice+'\n\n`node server.cjs` / Node.js >=20 / zero runtime npm dependencies.\n\nGuide.zh-TW.html: \u4e2d\u6587\u64cd\u4f5c\u5c0e\u89bd\u8207\u82f1\u6587\u6280\u8853\u754c\u7dda\u3002\n\nKoma-Atelier-Study.html: \u514d\u5b89\u88dd\u7dda\u7a3f\u6848\u4f8b\uff0c\u8acb\u532f\u51fa\u5132\u5b58\u3002\n\nSee AGENTS.md and docs/ATELIER-COMMANDS.md for 16 MCP tools and 24 typed operations.\n')
(R/'RELEASE-NOTES.md').write_text('# 0.6.0-alpha / Atelier\n\nSee docs/AUDIT-IMPLEMENTATION-MATRIX.json for all 26 audited conclusions.\n\nFive drawing planes; revision-aware native seed paint; safe split/merge handling; authored shading dependencies; ten-stage review DAG; named references/parts/anchors; conservative protected scopes; actual image MCP; editing leases; measured trial logs. New commands and old prod_* edits share invalidation.\n\n24 typed authoring commands, 16 MCP tools total. No model API, subscription or runtime package install.\n\nBrowser localhost navigation is policy-blocked in the evaluation environment. The new integration suite explicitly records its test-only transport bridge to real HTTP. It does not claim live Codex or native same-origin browser acceptance.\n\nArtwork remains an authored/native functional study, not animation-film-grade assets. Read Guide.zh-TW.html for numerical and workflow limitations.\n')
(R/'docs/STATUS.md').write_text('# Current release: 0.6.0-alpha\n\nCurrent conclusions/status/limits: AUDIT-IMPLEMENTATION-MATRIX.json.\nCurrent authoring contract: ATELIER-COMMANDS.md and ATELIER-SCHEMAS.json.\nCurrent tests: ../evidence/v060/test-report.json.\nHistorical documents in previous/ and archive-v0.1 are historical, not new acceptance claims.\n')
p=R/'README.md';s=p.read_text().replace('0.5.0-alpha','0.6.0-alpha');s='# Koma Atelier 0.6 release\n\nStart with Guide.zh-TW.html (Chinese navigation, English technical contracts).\n`node server.cjs` requires Node >=20; no runtime npm dependencies.\n\nOffline: Koma-Atelier-Study.html for a disposable native drawing example; Koma-Production-Standalone.html for projects. Save before closing.\n\nAll 26 audit conclusions are mapped to implementation and limits in docs/AUDIT-IMPLEMENTATION-MATRIX.json. New MCP contracts: docs/ATELIER-COMMANDS.md.\n\n'+s;p.write_text(s)
p=R/'plugin-manifest.json';d=json.loads(p.read_text());d['version']='0.6.0-alpha';d['atelier']={'uiWorkspaces':8,'typedOperations':24,'mcpTools':16,'productionStages':10,'matrix':'docs/AUDIT-IMPLEMENTATION-MATRIX.json','nativePaintBudgetPixels':2097152};p.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Built 26-conclusion matrix and bilingual offline guide.')
